# Mechanical: what a machine writes for any contract. Complete and visible, and not pleasant.
screen Home
  inbox
  me: identity, person
  list People: everyone; shows knows, friend; opens Person
  Establish
  Acquaint: Bob = field
  Introduce: Bob = pick of knows, Carol = pick of knows
  Befriend: Bob = pick of knows
  Unfriend: Bob = pick of friend

screen Person(p)
  inbox
  p: knows, friend
